/ helper.pa
/ Helper routine to enable watchdog and call GETCHR
/ Location: 00100
/ Sets watchdog to HALT after 10 seconds, then calls GETCHR

*00100

HELPER,
    CLA CLL
    TAD WDOG_HALT_10SEC     / Watchdog command: HALT after 10 seconds
    IOT 6552                / Set watchdog timer (WRITE command)
    JMS GETCHR              / Call GETCHR
    HLT

WDOG_HALT_10SEC, 03144      / Watchdog: HALT (one-shot) after 10 seconds (cmd=3, count=100ds)

/ read a single character from the keyboard (TTY)
/ Input: none
/ Output: AC contains character read
/ Preserves: none (clobbers AC)
GETCHR, 0
    IOT 6031                / KSF: Skip if keyboard ready
    JMP .-1                 / Wait if not ready
    IOT 6036                / KRB: Read character into AC
    JMP I GETCHR            / Return

